// An array as a value, chart instances and references: ref bind scalar int. KIELER rejects it: 2:74 The referencing
// binding is erroneous!.
scchart Main { int a[2] = {4,7} int c[2] output int x initial state A is Sub(a, x) } scchart Sub { input int p output int o initial state A do o = p go to A }
